  "question": {
    "text": "Two sides of a triangle are given by the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and the angle between the sides is <math><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>. The perimeter of the triangle is",
